    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Autopass (\"快速通\") is a Taiwan mobility financial-services platform that lets channel brand partners embed license-plate-based parking payment into their car-owner apps. Partners register user license plates, surface partner parking locations (POIs), read parking sessions and orders, and receive entry/exit/billing/refund notifications. This description reflects the operations and response fields published in the Autopass partner documentation; it is an API Evangelist reconstruction, not a provider-issued spec.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Autopass",
      "type": "text/plain"
